## Git (strict whitelist)

- Agent may run **only** `git status` and `git diff` (any flags: `--stat`,
  `--name-only`, range specs, paths).
- **Forbidden:** every other git subcommand (`log`, `show`, `add`, `commit`,
  `push`, `pull`, `fetch`, `checkout`, `branch`, `reset`, `rebase`, `stash`,
  `clean`, `config`, `merge`, `tag`, etc.).
- **Forbidden:** scripts or chained shell that invoke any git subcommand other
  than `status` or `diff`.
- No exceptions. User runs all other git operations manually.
